
# Oracle EBS - AP Payment Analysis Report

Este repositório contém uma query SQL desenvolvida para o módulo **Oracle Payables (AP)** do Oracle E-Business Suite (R12).

## 📋 Objetivo
A query extrai informações detalhadas sobre pagamentos efetuados a fornecedores, relacionando-os diretamente com as faturas (Invoices) correspondentes. É ideal para processos de auditoria, conciliação bancária e análise de fluxo de caixa histórico.



SELECT
    d.name                              "OU",
    a.bank_account_name                 "Account Number",
    v.segment1                          "Supplier Number",
    a.vendor_name                       "Supplier name",
    vs.attribute2                       "GSL",
    a.city                              "City",
    TO_CHAR(a.check_date, 'DD/MM/RRRR') "Payment Date",
    TO_CHAR(b.accounting_date, 'DD/MM/RRRR') "GL Date",
    a.check_number                      "Payment Number",
    a.amount                            "Payment Amount",
    a.currency_code                     "Currency",
    a.payment_method_lookup_code        "Payment Method",
    NVL(a.exchange_rate, 1)             "Rate",
    (a.amount * NVL(a.exchange_rate, 1)) "Payment Amount - converted",
    c.invoice_num                       "Invoice Number",
    b.payment_num                       "Installment",
    TO_CHAR(c.invoice_date, 'DD/MM/RRRR') "Invoice Date",
    b.amount                            "Payment amount of Invoice",
    (b.amount * NVL(a.exchange_rate, 1)) "Invoice amount - converted"
FROM
    apps.ap_checks_all           a,
    apps.ap_invoice_payments_all b,
    apps.ap_invoices_all         c,
    apps.hr_operating_units      d,
    apps.po_vendor_sites_all     vs,
    apps.po_vendors              v
WHERE
        a.check_id = b.check_id
    AND a.org_id = b.org_id
    AND b.invoice_id = c.invoice_id
    AND b.org_id = c.org_id
    AND a.org_id = d.organization_id
    AND c.vendor_site_id = vs.vendor_site_id
    AND vs.vendor_id = v.vendor_id
    -- Filtros de Negócio
    AND a.check_date >= '01-JAN-2013'
    AND a.check_date < '31-DEC-2013'
    AND a.void_date IS NULL
    AND a.amount <> 0
ORDER BY
    d.name,
    a.vendor_name,
    c.invoice_num;
